      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think arm length should be the default still since a majority of users are 3pt & that's more accurate to the tracking data they have. It'd be nice if there was a prompt for first time FBT users about the alternate option.",
      "viewerReactions": null
