      "value": "@{5f50687837bf962e69ae2921|full_name}: Making short/long arm avatars feel right by default is more important than making the floor height correct for new users, in my opinion.\nIf you care about the floor you're a power user and can figure out how to change it. Most people just want the arms to work and will think the avatars are broken if they don't just work out of the box.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
